# Git and pull requests

Before committing, pushing, or creating or updating any PR, read `~/AGENTS.md` and follow its `Git workflow` and `Pull request descriptions` sections. Apply them to every repository and every PR in a stack, including drafts and small changes. These personal defaults override Graphite requirements and optional diagram guidance in repository instructions and skills.
